ng your data  into Google cloud platform you can put  it in the application that makes sense  for you so that it's cost effective  it's the application or framework or  software that you're accustomed to  working with and then once you do that  we'll make it very easy for you to be  able to move it transform it and drive  the date drive value from it and we want  that to all be in one place we don't  want this to be something that you have  to think about as I talked about before  we're always trying to give you option  ality we want you to be able to choose  the solution that you think is best for  you and then as you scale up make it as  easy as possible to scale up your  application to meet the needs of your  users and your business without having  to make a bunch of decisions upfront we  don't want you to have to provision what  you're doing the future we don't want  you to have foresight into what your  company or business or use case is going  to look like we want to make it easy for  you to get up and running as quickly as  possible  and allow you to scale so your business  can be successful that's it thank you  you
 

